<aside class="spaceship-sidebar">
    <div class="portrait">
        <img src="{{document.img}}" alt="{{document.name}}" data-action="editImage" data-edit="img">
    </div>

    <div class="info-section {{#if useResourcePips}}pip-display{{/if}}">
        <div class="resources-section">
            {{! HP/Stress (#10 addendum): "Pip display for Resources" world setting. Pip branch
                unchanged from before; the number-bar branch is the official character sheet's
                `resource-bar.hbs` else-branch by value, minus the `<progress>` bar's own color
                class (that partial hard-codes none for these two, only Shield's stress-color one
                below carries one) - `name` binds straight to the persisted resource field, so the
                sheet's own `submitOnChange` form handles the write with no listener needed. }}
            {{#if useResourcePips}}
            <div class="slot-value">
                <div class="slot-bar">
                    {{#each (dhscifiResourceBoxes document.system.resources.hitPoints.value document.system.resources.hitPoints.max) as |box|}}
                        <span
                            class="slot {{#if box.filled}}filled{{/if}}"
                            data-action="toggleHitPoints"
                            data-resource="hitPoints"
                            data-value="{{box.index}}"
                        ></span>
                    {{/each}}
                </div>
                <div class="slot-label">
                    <span class="label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.HitPoints"}}</span>
                    <span class="value">{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.value}} / {{document.system.resources.hitPoints.max}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="slot-value">
                <div class="slot-bar">
                    {{#each (dhscifiResourceBoxes document.system.resources.stress.value document.system.resources.stress.max) as |box|}}
                        <span
                            class="slot {{#if box.filled}}filled{{/if}}"
                            data-action="toggleStress"
                            data-resource="stress"
                            data-value="{{box.index}}"
                        ></span>
                    {{/each}}
                </div>
                <div class="slot-label">
                    <span class="label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Stress"}}</span>
                    <span class="value">{{document.system.resources.stress.value}} / {{document.system.resources.stress.max}}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{else}}
            <div class="status-bar">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <progress class="progress-bar" max="{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.max}}" value="{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.value}}"></progress>
                    <input class="bar-input" name="system.resources.hitPoints.value" min="0" max="{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.max}}" value="{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.value}}" type="number">
                    <span>/</span>
                    <span class="bar-label">{{document.system.resources.hitPoints.max}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label pointy">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.HitPoints"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="status-bar">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <progress class="progress-bar" max="{{document.system.resources.stress.max}}" value="{{document.system.resources.stress.value}}"></progress>
                    <input class="bar-input" name="system.resources.stress.value" min="0" max="{{document.system.resources.stress.max}}" value="{{document.system.resources.stress.value}}" type="number">
                    <span>/</span>
                    <span class="bar-label">{{document.system.resources.stress.max}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label pointy">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Stress"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{/if}}
        </div>

        <div class="status-section {{#if useResourcePips}}pip-display{{/if}}">
            <div class="status-number evasion-stat">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <p>{{document.system.evasion}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Evasion"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            {{! Shield (#10): the equipped armor item's score, marked off slot by slot. Same two
                branches, classes, and icons as the official character sheet's armor slots, now
                including its `useResourcePips` split - the number-bar branch's input has no
                `name` (`armorScore` is derived, nothing to bind straight to) and instead goes
                through `#bindShieldInput`/`markShield`, same as core's `.armor-marks-input`/
                `updateArmorMarks` pairing. }}
            {{#if document.system.armorScore.max}}
                <div class="status-bar armor-slots shield-stat">
                    {{#if useResourcePips}}
                    <div class="slot-value">
                        <div class="slot-bar armor">
                            {{#each (dhscifiResourceBoxes document.system.armorScore.value document.system.armorScore.max) as |box|}}
                                <a class="slot" data-action="toggleShield" data-value="{{box.index}}">
                                    {{#if box.filled}}
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield"></i>
                                    {{else}}
                                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                                    {{/if}}
                                </a>
                            {{/each}}
                        </div>
                        <div class="slot-label">
                            <span class="label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Shield"}}</span>
                            <div class="slot-value-container">
                                <span class="value">{{document.system.armorScore.value}} / {{document.system.armorScore.max}}</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    {{else}}
                    <div class="status-value">
                        <progress class="progress-bar stress-color" value="{{document.system.armorScore.value}}" max="{{document.system.armorScore.max}}"></progress>
                        <input class="bar-input shield-marks-input" value="{{document.system.armorScore.value}}" type="number" id="{{document.uuid}}-shield-slots">
                        <span>/</span>
                        <span class="bar-label">{{document.system.armorScore.max}}</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-label">
                        <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Shield"}}</h4>
                    </div>
                    {{/if}}
                </div>
            {{else}}
                <div class="status-number armor-slots shield-stat">
                    <div class="status-value">
                        <p>-</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="status-label">
                        <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Shield"}}</h4>
                    </div>
                </div>
            {{/if}}
            <div class="status-number proficiency-stat">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <p>{{document.system.proficiency}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Proficiency"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        {{! Damage thresholds (#10). Same label/value interleaving as the official sheet: each
            value is the *boundary* between the band named to its left and the one to its right. }}
        <div class="threshold-section">
            <h4 class="threshold-label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Thresholds.minor"}}</h4>
            <h4 class="threshold-value">{{document.system.damageThresholds.major}}</h4>
            <h4 class="threshold-label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Thresholds.major"}}</h4>
            <h4 class="threshold-value">{{document.system.damageThresholds.severe}}</h4>
            <h4 class="threshold-label">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Thresholds.severe"}}</h4>
        </div>

        {{! Crew/passenger capacity (#16): informational only (user story 22, #3) - GM-entered
            maximums with no live count to compare against, so each is a single-value stat, same
            `status-number` markup the Evasion/Proficiency stats above use. }}
        <div class="status-section">
            <div class="status-number crew-stat">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <p>{{document.system.maxCrew}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Crew"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="status-number passengers-stat">
                <div class="status-value">
                    <p>{{document.system.maxPassengers}}</p>
                </div>
                <div class="status-label">
                    <h4>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.Passengers"}}</h4>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    {{! Equipped-weapons list (#17), below the thresholds section: every currently-equipped
        `weapon` item, mirroring the fields (name/icon/damage) daggerheart's own character sidebar
        shows for its equipped items - see `templates/partials/equipped-weapon.hbs`. Same
        `equippedWeapons` derivation the header's mount chip counts (`#buildEquippedWeapons`),
        so the two can never disagree about which weapons are equipped. }}
    <div class="equipped-weapons-section">
        <div class="title">
            <side-line-div class="invert"></side-line-div>
            <h3>{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.EquippedWeapons"}}</h3>
            <side-line-div></side-line-div>
        </div>
        {{#if equippedWeapons.length}}
            <ul class="items-sidebar-list">
                {{#each equippedWeapons as |weapon|}}
                    {{> "dhscifi.equipped-weapon" weapon=weapon}}
                {{/each}}
            </ul>
        {{else}}
            <p class="no-equipped-weapons">{{localize "DHSCIFI.Spaceship.NoEquippedWeapons"}}</p>
        {{/if}}
    </div>
</aside>
